<view class="screen"><view class="hero"><view class="hero-icon">✨</view><view class="eyebrow">YOUR STARLIGHT COLLECTION</view><view class="title">小小星光，
大大成长</view><view class="subtitle">每一座奖杯，都记得你努力的样子。</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在数一数星光…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="retry">再试一次</button></view><block wx:if="{{!loading &amp;&amp; !error}}"><view wx:if="{{player}}" class="card"><view class="row"><view>{{avatars[player.avatar]}} {{player.name}}</view><view class="stars">⭐ {{stars}}</view></view><view class="muted">已收集 {{trophies.length}} 座奖杯 · 每课有三种挑战等你发现</view></view><view wx:else class="card empty"><view class="badge">🐰</view><view class="section-title">为新朋友留一个位置</view><button class="primary" bindtap="players">创建角色</button></view><view class="trophy-grid"><button wx:for="{{trophies}}" wx:key="index" class="trophy" data-id="{{item.lessonId}}" bindtap="openLesson"><view class="badge">🏆</view><view>第 {{item.lessonId}} 课</view><view class="muted">{{item.label}}</view><view class="pill">最好 {{item.bestScore}} / 5</view></button></view><view wx:if="{{player &amp;&amp; !trophies.length}}" class="card empty"><view class="badge">🌱</view><view class="section-title">你的第一颗星光在路上</view><view class="muted">去听一个故事，再完成五道小挑战。</view><button bindtap="map" class="primary">开始冒险</button></view></block></view>
